title: military_tower_context
---
// The garrison of the General's tower (the Iron Bastion, `military_tower`),
// one node per soldier, named `military_tower_<soldier>`. The room is written
// by `tools/ambition_ldtk_tools/specs/military_tower_area.ron`; the General's
// own talk is `military_general` in `factions.yarn`. The soldiers are made by
// the character generator (renderer `data/townsfolk/tower_*.chargen.yaml`).
//
// Never played. No placement names this node; it declares the zone.
===

title: military_tower_voss
---
Casey: EYES FRONT. You are standing on my parade deck, and anyone on my parade deck is on parade.
-> What do you drill here?
    Casey: Marching. Saluting. Standing still with conviction. Standing still is harder than it looks. Watch Dorsey.
-> Fall out.
===

title: military_tower_dorsey
---
Dorsey: Halt! Who goes... oh. You. Go on, then. I am mostly here to say halt.
-> What is through the annex door?
    Dorsey: The gate annex. The checkpoint opens for clearance only, and clearance comes from the General.
    Dorsey: I do not know about the maintenance crawlway. I am not allowed to know about the maintenance crawlway.
-> Carry on, Private.
===

title: military_tower_tanaka
---
Tanaka: Off duty. If this is about the bunk inspection, my corners are regulation. Bankole's corners are a crime.
-> What do you do on duty?
    Tanaka: Night watch on the signals floor. Mostly I listen to Ruiz's printer print nothing.
-> Leave her to it.
===

title: military_tower_bankole
---
Bankole: Corporal Bankole. The beret is not regulation in the barracks. I am testing whether anybody up here outranks me.
-> And?
    Bankole: Nobody has come down to check in three weeks. Either I outrank everybody, or the stairs are a ladder. It is the ladder.
-> As you were.
===

title: military_tower_granger
---
Granger: Quartermaster's counter. Sign for it, return it, or explain it. Mostly people explain it.
-> What can I draw from the armory?
    Granger: Nothing without a chit. The chits are upstairs. The forms for the chits are downstairs. Welcome to the army.
-> Never mind.
===

title: military_tower_ruiz
---
Ruiz: Signals. Every dial of the annex ring prints a line on my tape.
-> Who dialed today?
    Ruiz: SENTINEL, twice. Both times it was the General, checking that the printer works. It works.
-> Back to your tape.
===

title: military_tower_brandt
---
Brandt: Major Brandt, adjutant. The General sees visitors on the hour.
-> When is the hour?
    Brandt: Now. It is always the hour. He does not own a watch, and nobody has volunteered to give him one.
-> Thank you, Major.
===
